                          snapshot EVERYTHING a zip of this folder would miss — the databases,
                          n8n workflows+credentials, documents, auth users, sync cursors — into
                          exports/ (gitignored), so zipping the folder now carries the deployment.
                          ${cy}full${c0} = with execution history + OCR caches; ${cy}config${c0} = without them.
  bbox import [DIR]       restore an archive into THIS checkout. Refuses to overwrite the
                          deployment it came from. Verifies every artifact's sha256 first, then
                          diffs per-table row counts and credential ciphertext against the source.

${c1}Healthy baseline${c0}  (the one-command fresh proof — ai/context/healthy-baseline.md)
  bbox baseline           ${cg}fresh${c0} reset→build→up→ci-verify→indox test→any-concurrency+notifications
