${c1}n8n${c0}  (LIVE is the source of truth; blueprints are CODE — *.workflow.ts. Agents: pull → edit → push, always.)
  bbox n8n pull <app> [wfId ...]   live → code, just what you'll edit (whole app when no ids)
  bbox n8n pull all                whole estate + credentials + manifest (routed by app:* tags)
  bbox n8n push <app> <wfId ...>   push exactly those via the n8n API (no restart, hot triggers)
  bbox n8n push <app> [--all]      changed-only (sha cache) / force whole app
  bbox n8n push all                FULL reconciler: owner+creds+schema+import+publish+RESTART
  bbox n8n status                  co-op sync: who changed what live, drift, published, creds, key
  bbox n8n test <app> <wfId>       trigger + verdict (exit 0=inform/don't block, 1=fix+iterate)
  bbox n8n plan <app> <wfId>       infer how to test + suggested payload (--json)
  bbox n8n execute -n <node.json> <input.json>   run ONE node on your items (--ex-link keeps it)
  bbox n8n exec list|get ...       execution diagnosis via the API
  bbox n8n code validate|info|search|docs <args>   offline authoring intelligence (537 schemas)
  bbox n8n code render|compile|verify <src> [out]  transformer pipeline (verify = CI gate)
  bbox n8n verify                  cred connect-tests + missing-key warnings + re-auth links
  bbox n8n clean-recreate [--force]   wipe n8n then restore EXACTLY from blueprint
  bbox n8n load-dump <f>           one-off ingest of a prod n8n Postgres dump
  bbox n8n automations reset [--force]  ${cr}clean app STATE${c0} (sheet rows+log tabs cleared, Drive
                          folders emptied, Gmail auto-labels stripped, Redis caches cleared) for a
                          clean re-onboarding. Dry-run without --force. (≠ 'bbox reset' = infra wipe)

${c1}apps + catalog${c0}  (the app store: a SIGNED index, install by reference)
  bbox apps list|validate            resolved plan / manifest validation
  bbox apps enable|disable <app>     persistent disposition (data always kept)
  bbox catalog keygen               create this deployment's ed25519 signing key
  bbox catalog build                compile apps/ -> .generated/catalog (index + artifacts + signature)
  bbox catalog verify [ref]         check the signature AND every per-entry sha256
  bbox catalog list [ref]           entries in an index (path or URL)
  bbox catalog show <id>            ${cg}pre-install disclosure${c0} — credentials first, then powers, routes, cost
  bbox catalog trust <key-id> <hex> pin a publisher's public key (the one trust decision)
